> Stefi has degrees in medical history[ (]UC Berkeley) and international public health (UCLA). In 2010 she co-founded the Sustainable Healthcare Education network[ to] integrate sustainability[ and] health into medical and nursing education. She led public health[ teaching] at Norwich Medical School,[ global] public health at Azim[ Premji University] in Bangalore, and violence prevention for the Medical Peace Work Partnership at the University of[ Ber]gen,[ Norway].

